ate :provenance heap sibling\n602e9fae docs(exception-track): the py-r2r3 r2 round dispatched — the kit-parity pin first, then the divergence fix (suspects: double-wrapping of already-qualified conditions, egress re-qualification, receive-path re-wrapper)\nca10afa4 Merge cc2-transform-session-c1: transform and session C1 preservation\n31287b17 fix(yang.typescript): private identity-store provenance — membership, not wrapper metadata\na1133cbe fix(yang.clojure): cc2 r3+r4 — admission pairing from commit evidence, wrapper provenance from assembly\nfbd8da0f fix(yang.clojure): raw ordinary payloads, heap-retained protocol wrapper (R3 (A))\nc9c5533c fix(yang.clojure): caught payload identity — guest operations observe the visible value, not the wrapper (R3)\nc0114a42 fix(yang.typescript): bridge JS entries to the supplied raise exit (R1) and retain protocol conditions (R3)\n2d170926 feat(yang.clojure): cc2 — transform and session C1 preservation\ndb2434dd fix(yang.clojure): generated exception wrapper — provenance outside the condition map (R3 review fixes)\nb0463cd2 fix(yang.call): publish the exception kit's donors C1-finalized — publication refused meant every clojure-donor row ran blind\nc638c4ea docs(build-n-test): the 04:00 VN nightly cron is currently disabled — wrappers stay installed, re-arming is one crontab line (owner instruction 2026-11-06)\n1d9c8e81 docs(delegate-reference): the J6G-mob round's qwen/deepseek failures were brief-and-cwd errors, not lane failures\n53a71b26 docs(agents): withdraw the qwen wrapper lane — name collides with Alibaba's separate qwen-code agent; measurement preserved for a renamed re-creation\n1ccdd91c docs(agents): the delegate lane is qwen, not bailian — bl is account management only, the qwen wrapper is the coding path\na8e867bb docs(agents): bailian/qwen measured and live — Token Plan wrapper recipe, catalog (qwen3.8-max/flash), and the bl config agent takeover caution\nf279fe03 docs(collab): archive the yang.clojure cc4 + constructed-collection-ordering record\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1794932555000-engineer-cc4-fourhost-equality.gpt-6.1-terra.stdout.log\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1794932555000-engineer-cc4-fourhost-equality.prompt.md\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795000000000-engineer-cc4-r2.gpt-6.1-terra.stdout.log\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795017757000-architect-cc4-dart-map-order-ruling.gpt-6-astra.findings.md\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795017757000-architect-cc4-dart-map-order-ruling.gpt-6-astra.stdout.log\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795017757000-architect-cc4-dart-map-order-ruling.prompt.md\n39562f7c fix(yang): canonical ordering for constructed map/set operands — ruling 1795017757000\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
